  "graph-dijkstra": {"icon":"🚦","lead":"Always settle the closest unsettled node next using a priority queue, then try to shorten the routes through it.","summary":"Always expand the unfinished node with the smallest known distance, using a min-heap, and relax its outgoing edges. It finds shortest paths when no edge weight is negative.","animation":"743-network-delay-time","practice":["743-network-delay-time","1514-path-with-maximum-probability","1631-path-with-minimum-effort","1971-find-if-path-exists-in-graph"],"examples":["743-network-delay-time","1514-path-with-maximum-probability","1631-path-with-minimum-effort"]},
